*% Status: tested. Profile notes:
*%   Reports itself over USB as an Epson TM-T88III, firmware '7.03 ESC/POS' (GS I 66/67/65); IEEE-1284 ID says COMMENDSET:EPSON. Answers DLE EOT status queries.
*%   GS v 0 raster, 1 = black; one 1600-row (200 mm) raster prints in full. Longer not yet tested.
*%   Use feed-then-cut (GS V 66 0 / GS V 65 0): GS V 0 cuts at once and slices the last printed lines.
*%   Partial and full cut look the same on this unit. Cash drawer kick (ESC p) not yet tested.
*%   USB ID 0fe6:811e is shared by many Chinese receipt printers.
*% Engine: uniprint  (one Ghostscript run, every page printed)
*% Uses only commands allowed by ChromeOS foomatic_shell.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "RONGTA-R.PPD"
